(module display_width
	(:copyright "Copyright (c) 2026 wove contributors")
	(:license "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT OR Apache-2.0")
	(:doc `Measure the display cells used by decoded Unicode scalars in source excerpts.

	Width transitions derive from Unicode 17.0.0 EastAsianWidth, DerivedGeneralCategory,
	and DerivedCoreProperties. Ambiguous scalars occupy one cell. The Unicode data
	license is in UNICODE-LICENSE.txt alongside this module.`)

	(fn width_transitions
		(:doc `Return sorted transitions packed as a code point followed by two width bits.

		Wide and fullwidth scalars occupy two cells. Combining and format marks,
		grapheme extenders, and Hangul medial and final jamo occupy zero cells.`)
